<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We are offering to qualified investors limited partner interests and general partner interests
in a series of two Delaware limited partnerships formed or to be formed by us. We will sell these
