may accept a subscription for less than twenty interests ($20,000) or for more than five hundred
interests ($500,000), but in no event will we accept a subscription for less than ten interests
($10,000). The maximum number of interests that we will offer for any one partnership is 50,000.
Therefore, the minimum offering amount for any one partnership will be $5,000,000 and the maximum
offering amount for any one partnership will be $50,000,000. A partnership will not commence
operations or have any material assets or liabilities prior to the termination of the subscription
period for interests in such partnership.
