Corporation, the managing partner, in its sole discretion, accelerates or delays the offering
termination date, provided that its ability to delay the offering termination date is subject to
its obligation to return the purchase price for any interests not invested in a partnership within
any period required by state securities law.
</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A partnership will not be funded with less than $5,000,000 in subscriptions from investors.
