<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<I>Tax Liabilities in Excess of Cash Distributions</I>. A partner must report and pay income tax on his
share of partnership income, regardless of whether such income is retained and used for debt
