<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Because depletion will be computed separately by each investor partner and not at the
partnership level, no assurance can be given, and counsel to the managing partner is unable to
