<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Section&nbsp;3.1 <U>Capital Contributions of Investor Partners</U>. Each subscriber shall be accepted
