<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Section&nbsp;6.1 <U>Rights of Investor Partners</U>. In addition to any other rights specifically set
forth herein, all Investor Partners shall have the right to: (a)&nbsp;have the Partnership books kept at
the principal place of business of the Partnership and upon adequate written notice at all
reasonable times inspect and, at such Investor Partner&#146;s expense, copy any of them personally or
