<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Section&nbsp;3. Allocation of Costs. The costs of activities and operations conducted pursuant to this
Agreement shall be allocated to and paid by the parties hereto as follows:
