<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(a)&nbsp;Organization and Offering Expenses, Sales Commissions and Due Diligence Fees. All
Organization and Offering Expenses attributable to the Partnership shall be allocated to and paid
